===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|unobtainable|alt1=unobtain(able)|ium|pos2=''suffix creating scientific- or humorous-sounding fictional substance names''}}, modelled after {{m|en|uranium}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=407563|date=December 2014|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n|us=yes}}</ref>

